T:Abide, O Dearest Jesus
T:CHRISTUS DER IST MEIN LEBEN
C:Music: Melchior Vulpius, 1609 · Words: Joshua Stegmann, 1628. Translated by August Crull circa 1892
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "Mehrstimmiges ChoralBuch", 1906 Hymn #32, page 23 Ed. Karl Brauer.. The hymnary.org score found for comparison (hymnary.org/tune/christus_der_ist_mein_leben_vulpius) is a different tune or version, so the melody follows the Open Hymnal's source.
